    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλάταια</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλᾰ], ἡ</span>, <i><span class="en">
